# R package library cache used by the fast-setup recipe (doc/adaptive_gcv_setup.md).
# Never commit an installed R library into the repo. The recommended cache lives
# OUTSIDE this repo at /projects/sandbox/.Rcache (the workspace root is not a git
# repo), but ignore these names here too in case a cache is created inside the tree.
.Rcache/
.Rcache_bench/
.Rsrc_bench/
